{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54609","headline":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵（首本作「风」，此从辛本）发日，风雨逆沾人。\n天意示（辛本作「欲」）知教我记，不须前进恐危身，见阵溃亡军。\n（《军行志》：如行军见暴风猛雨，倒折旗枪，大雨不止者，天之怒也，军不可进。\n宜待天象和明，别择日时门户，军行方吉也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}